{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 20, :comments ["<b>I have pardoned according to your word.</b> When I said, 'I will smite them with the plague,' I had already pardoned in the manner you request — for the intent was not to put them all to death at once, but to cause them all to die gradually in the wilderness, so that none of them enters the land."], :book :numbers, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 14, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:39:47.878351472Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}